  "notes": "Single-page Wix site with no per-trip pages; trip photos are matched by position in the Tours and Learn to Dive sections. Logo is the business logo declared in the site's own metadata; a second candidate, 2093ca_8cc3d422b0ed4dcba12aeabae40056b2~mv2.png (named 'g fish_edited.png'), sits at the top of the page. The four gallery pages (building-blessed, family-fun, sinking-trident, underwater) load their photos in the browser, so a plain fetch returned none. Left out Wix stock media (11062b_ and a3c153_ background videos, and unprefixed stock images), social icons and review badges. The videos have no captions, so their titles only say where on the page they sit."
